m red immediately before detonation.\",\"Partition the sprite so each 8x8 hardware piece uses no more than three visible colors plus transparency\u2014for example black/blue/white for the mantle and black/white/red for the face.\",\"Reduce the highlight to a small one- or two-pixel cluster that follows the mantle's curvature.\"]}",
